      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudi Yelemiya ku nyima kua diba diakadi Nebuzaladana, kapitene ka bansentedi ba masalayi, umulekele ku Lama, wakadi mumusangane musuika ne nkanu munkatshi mua ba mu Yelushalema ne ba mu Yuda bakakuatabo, ne bakadibo baya nʼabo mu buhika ku Babulona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapitene ka bansentedi kakakuata Yelemiya, kakamuambila ne, Yehowa Nzambi webe wakahisha bena musoko eu ne mulau eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakushikisha dî diandi, wakuenza bu muakambeye; bualu bua nuakenzela Yehowa bibi, kanuakatumikila dî diandi; nunku malu a onso akunukuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mona, lelu eu ndi nkusulula nkanu ei idi ku bianza biebi. Biwamona ne, Mbimpe bua kuya nʼanyi ku Babulona, lua nʼanyi, ne meme nenkuenzele bimpe. Kadi biwamona ne, Kulua nʼanyi ku Babulona kakuena kuimpe, wanji kushala; tangila, buloba buonso budi ku mpala kuebe; udi mua kuya ku muaba wonso udi umueneka ku mesu kuebe bu muaba muimpe ne mukumbane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biwashala, uhingane kudi Gedaliya, muana wa Ahikama, muana wa Shafana, wakutekabo gouverneur wa misoko ya mu Yuda kudi mukelenge wa Babulona; ushikame nʼandi munkatshi mua bantu; anyi uye biebe kuonso kukuabo kudi kuimpe ku mesu kuebe. Nunku kapitene ka bansentedi kakamuha bia kudia ne matabisha, kakamulekela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe, Yelemiya wakaya kudi Gedaliya, muana wa Ahikama, ku Misepa; wakashikama nʼandi munkatshi mua bantu bakadi bashala mu buloba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua tupitene tuonso tua masalayi akadi mu mpata ne bena nvita batu kabidi ne, Mukelenge wa Babulona wakuteka Gedaliya muana wa Ahikama, gouverneur mu buloba, wakufila balume ne bakashi ne bana, bobo mene bakadi bahele ne bakadi kabayi baye mu buhika mu Babulona mu bianza biandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakalua kudi Gedaliya mu Misepa. Menʼabo akadi Yishemaele, muana wa Netanya, Yohanana ne Yonatana, bana balume ba Kalea, Selaya, muana wa Tanehumeta, bana balume ba Efai, Muena Netofa, ne Yezanya, muana wa Muena Mâka, bobo mene ne bantu babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedaliya, muana wa Ahikama, muana wa Shafana, wakaditshiha kudibo ne kudi bantu balume babo ne, Kanutshinyi kukuatshila Bena Kasada mudimu. Shikamai mu buloba, nukuatshile mukelenge wa Babulona mudimu, nenuikale ne diakalengele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mona, meme hanyi nenshikame mu Misepa, bua kunuakuila ku mpala kua Bena Kasada badi balua kutumona; kadi nuenu nusangishe tumuma tua nvinyo ne mamuma makuabo ne manyi, nubiteke mu mpanza yenu, nushikame mu misoko inuakuangata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muomumue, hakunvua Bena Yuda bakadi mu Moaba ne munkatshi mua Bena Amona ne mu Edome ne bakadi mu makelenge makuabo onso ne, Mukelenge wa Babulona wakashiya bantu bakuabo mu Yuda ne wakateka Gedaliya, muana wa Ahikama, muana wa Shafana, ku mutu kuabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yuda aba bonso bakumuka mu miaba yonso yakabatumabo, bakahingana, bakalua ku buloba bua Yuda, kudi Gedaliya mu Misepa, bakasangisha nvinyo ne mamuma bia bungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, ne tupitene tuonso tua bena nvita bakadi mu mpata bakalua kudi Gedaliya mu Misepa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakamuambila ne, Udi mumanye ne, Bâlisa, mukelenge wa Bena Amona, wakutuma Yishemaele, muana wa Netanya, bua kukushiha, anyi? Kadi Gedaliya, muana wa Ahikama, kakitabusha di diabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, wakambila Gedaliya ku Misepa mu musokoko ne, Ndi nkusengelela ne, Witabushe bua meme nye kushiha Yishemaele, muana wa Netanya, muntu kabumanyi. Bualu kai yeye udi ukeba kukushiha, bua Bena Yuda badi badisangisha kudi batangadishibue, ne bua ba mu Yuda badi bashala bafue? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Gedaliya, muana wa Ahikama, wakambila Yohanana, muana wa Kalea, ne, Kuenji bualu ebu nansha, bualu bua udi ushiminyina Yishemaele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
